IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il40-nouns`

-- Section 11 (נוקשות, entrenchment): "this Basic Law shall not be changed except by a Basic Law adopted by a majority of the members of the Knesset".
-- Row IL-40.  SEAT: the individual who asks whether a change to the Basic Law was made in the way the text requires.
-- The text says WHICH KIND OF ENACTMENT (a Basic Law) and HOW MANY (a majority of the members: more than half of them).  It does not say
-- the number of members: that is in Basic Law: The Knesset, which is not deposited, so the size of the Knesset is an INPUT (fork F5).
-- It entrenches the whole Basic Law, itself included ("חוק־יסוד זה"), with the one majority; there is no second, higher, majority.

§ `Section 11`

-- bl:60 | אין לשנות חוק־יסוד זה אלא בחוק־יסוד שהתקבל ברוב של חברי הכנסת.
@ref Basic Law s 11; Sefer HaChukim 5778 no. 2743 p. 898
GIVEN kind IS A `A kind of enactment`
      votesFor IS A NUMBER
      members IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 11 is met by a change made by` kind `adopted with` votesFor `votes of` members `members of the Knesset` MEANS
    kind EQUALS `a Basic Law` AND votesFor TIMES 2 GREATER THAN members

-- The text names no section of itself as outside s 11; every section 1 to 11 is within it.
@ref Basic Law s 11 ("חוק־יסוד זה", the whole Law)
GIVEN section IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 11 entrenches section` section MEANS
    IF section AT LEAST 1 AND section AT MOST 11 THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING
